# DO NOT EDIT THIS FILE UNLESS YOU KNOW WHAT YOU ARE DOING!!! #
###############################################################
#
#    FILE: .core
#    bbots (Twitch port) - built-in OWNER commands (system level)
#    Sourced on every message from an owner, before the owner modules.
#    These work in every channel the bot is in, and affect all of them.
